  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Sea Bath Salt Romantic Date, 250 g</strong><br/>\r\nBring on the shine and elevate your skin with the Sea Bath Salt Romantic Date.</p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Built-in pink, shimmering glitters deliver a radiant, delicate shimmer to your skin.</li>\n<li>A delicate fragrance leaves a long-lasting, beautiful scent trail on the body. Top notes – sweet marshmallow and flowers; heart notes unfold gradually with the scent of mandarin, orange blossom, and rose; base notes – violet, heliotrope, vanilla, musk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>The formula enriched with natural oils provides the body with extra care.</strong><br/>\n<strong>Rose oil </strong>provides gentle care and promotes skin health while perfectly moisturizing and nourishing it. Additionally, it features excellent cooling properties, locks in deep moisture, tones, and softens the skin, restoring its natural elasticity.<br/>\n<strong>Pearl extract </strong>actively boosts skin elasticity and helps smooth the appearance of fine lines.</p>\n </div>\n</div>",
